      "text": "ACS blocks in the application. RAI egress and managed-network controls remain independent.\nPreserved original: seven v4 agents + ACS Servicing Demo v4; baseline API / UI / OBO unchanged.\nThe private AKS helper is operator-only: it never relays chat. Architecture diagrams are not proof.",
